# Which simple_switch_grpc the topology launches. First non-comment line wins; it must be
# an absolute path to an executable, and ../lib beside it is picked up as LD_LIBRARY_PATH.
# Comment the line out (or delete this file) to go back to the stock /usr/local/bin build.
#
# Why this is pointed at bmv2-fast (2026-08-17): the stock build is -O0 with full logging,
# and on it the energy app's consolidation decision is traffic-insensitive -- links are
# declared 1 Gbps while the switches top out around 22 Mbps, so utilisation never leaves
# ~2% and the decision is identical with and without traffic (measured: same three
# switches, same order, both runs). Same ceiling that stops TE from ever seeing its 70%
# threshold. [Co-developed with claude code -- Adam]

/usr/local/bmv2-fast/bin/simple_switch_grpc
